---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout 
	title="Diceforce IT | Careers | Build A Future-Proof Engineering Career" 
	description="We don't believe in 'rockstars' who work in silos. Join Diceforce IT to work on cloud-native platforms, AI systems, and core enterprise applications."
	activePage="careers"
>
	<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col gap-16 md:gap-24">
		
		<!-- SECTION 1: HERO (2-Column Layout) -->
		<section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center animate-stagger-item">
			<!-- Left Column: Hero Copy -->
			<div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/10">
					<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 uppercase">JOIN US</span>
				</div>
				<h1 class="font-syne font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl tracking-tighter leading-[0.95] text-white select-text text-balance">
					Build A Future-Proof<br />
					Engineering Career With Us
				</h1>
				<p class="text-neutral-400 font-light text-base sm:text-lg max-w-xl mt-6 leading-relaxed select-text">
					We don’t believe in "rockstars" who work in silos and leave a trail of unmaintainable code behind them. We look for engineers who write clear documentation, mentor others, leave helpful code reviews, and appreciate that software development is a team sport.
				</p>
				<div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
					<a href="#positions" class="btn-primary">
						<span>Explore Open Positions</span>
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
						</svg>
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<!-- Right Column: Interactive 3D WebGL Particle System -->
			<div class="lg:col-span-5 relative w-full h-[350px] sm:h-[420px] lg:h-[480px] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
				<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#00deff]/[0.02] blur-[80px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
				<!-- Three.js Canvas Container -->
				<div id="canvas-container" class="w-full h-full cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing relative z-10"></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- SECTION 2: WHY WORK WITH US (Grid Layout) -->
		<section class="border-t border-white/5 pt-16 animate-stagger-item">
			<div class="space-y-4 mb-12">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
					<span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-cyan-400/80 uppercase">JOIN US</span>
				</div>
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-white tracking-tight leading-none select-text">
					Why Work With Us
				</h2>
				<p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-2xl select-text font-light">
					At Diceforce IT, we believe empowered engineers build exceptional technology. We appreciate having a collaborative environment where every team member works on technologies that shape the future.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
				<!-- Benefit Card 1 -->
				<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-cyan-500/20 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between h-auto min-h-[240px] group shadow-lg shadow-black/10">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400/5 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-400/10 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-cyan-400/10 group-hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-all duration-300 mb-4">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z" />
						</svg>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-medium text-white text-base mb-2 select-text">Work on Projects That Matter</h3>
						<p class="text-neutral-400 text-xs leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							We skip the micromanagement and focus on creating a space where you can do your best work on cloud-native platforms, AI systems, and core enterprise applications that solve genuine, real-world problems.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Benefit Card 2 -->
				<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-cyan-500/20 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between h-auto min-h-[240px] group shadow-lg shadow-black/10">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-400/5 text-blue-400 border border-blue-400/10 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-blue-400/10 group-hover:border-blue-400/30 transition-all duration-300 mb-4">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
						</svg>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-medium text-white text-base mb-2 select-text">Flexible Work Culture</h3>
						<p class="text-neutral-400 text-xs leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							You own your time and decide your workday. All that matters to us is your learning curve, accountability, and innovation-driven mindset.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Benefit Card 3 -->
				<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-cyan-500/20 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between h-auto min-h-[240px] group shadow-lg shadow-black/10">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-400/5 text-blue-400 border border-blue-400/10 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-blue-400/10 group-hover:border-blue-400/30 transition-all duration-300 mb-4">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6" />
						</svg>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-medium text-white text-base mb-2 select-text">Grow Without Limits</h3>
						<p class="text-neutral-400 text-xs leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							If you're an experienced professional or an aspiring engineer, we welcome you. At Diceforce IT, we offer you opportunities to take ownership, develop new skills, and build a rewarding long-term career.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Benefit Card 4 -->
				<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-cyan-500/20 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between h-auto min-h-[240px] group shadow-lg shadow-black/10">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400/5 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-400/10 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-cyan-400/10 group-hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-all duration-300 mb-4">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 .364l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z" />
						</svg>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-medium text-white text-base mb-2 select-text">Build Future-Ready Technology</h3>
						<p class="text-neutral-400 text-xs leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							We encourage you to develop production-ready AI systems using Agentic AI, Generative AI, RAG, MLOps, cloud-native platforms, and intelligent automation to drive the next generation of enterprise innovation.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- SECTION 3: CREATE YOUR CAREER (Paths / Tracks) -->
		<section class="border-t border-white/5 pt-16 animate-stagger-item">
			<div class="space-y-4 mb-12">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
					<span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-cyan-400/80 uppercase">SHARE YOUR INTEREST</span>
				</div>
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-white tracking-tight leading-none select-text">
					Create your career
				</h2>
				<p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-2xl select-text font-light">
					Select a career of your own, or submit a resume to explore custom career options available for you.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
				<!-- Path 1: Engineering Career -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.015] hover:border-cyan-500/30 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 group shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-cyan-500/5 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-400/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-400/20 font-mono text-sm font-bold">01</div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors select-text">
							1. Engineering Career
						</h3>
						<p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							We build, architect, and scale leading AI platforms to help our partners thrive in the dynamic technology environment.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<a href="#apply" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">
							<span>Apply For Engineering</span>
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
							</svg>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Path 2: Consulting Career -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.015] hover:border-blue-500/30 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 group shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-blue-500/5 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-400/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-400/20 font-mono text-sm font-bold">02</div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors select-text">
							2. Consulting Career
						</h3>
						<p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							We offer advisory and consulting services to our clients to create a meaningful impact for combating complex business challenges.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<a href="#apply" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">
							<span>Apply For Consulting</span>
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
							</svg>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- SECTION 4: OPEN POSITIONS (Accordion List) -->
		<section id="positions" class="border-t border-white/5 pt-16 scroll-mt-24 animate-stagger-item">
			<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-12">
				<div class="space-y-4">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-cyan-400/80 uppercase">EXPLORE OPPORTUNITIES</span>
					</div>
					<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-white tracking-tight leading-none select-text">
						Open Positions
					</h2>
					<p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xl select-text font-light">
						Choose a role to view the qualifications, requirements, and apply directly.
					</p>
				</div>
				
				<!-- Filter Buttons -->
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2 border border-white/5 rounded-full p-1 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md self-start sm:self-auto shrink-0 font-mono text-xs tracking-wider uppercase select-none">
					<button data-filter="all" class="filter-btn px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-cyan-400 bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-400/20 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer">All</button>
					<button data-filter="engineering" class="filter-btn px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-neutral-400 hover:text-white border border-transparent transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer">Engineering</button>
					<button data-filter="consulting" class="filter-btn px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-neutral-400 hover:text-white border border-transparent transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer">Consulting</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Positions Stack -->
			<div class="space-y-4">
				<!-- Position 1: AI Systems Engineer -->
				<div class="job-item border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] hover:bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-cyan-500/20 shadow-lg shadow-black/20" data-dept="engineering">
					<!-- Header (Trigger) -->
					<button class="w-full text-left p-6 sm:p-8 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer outline-none group/jobbtn">
						<div class="space-y-2">
							<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
								<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 bg-cyan-400/5 border border-cyan-400/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase">Engineering</span>
								<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-neutral-400 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase">Remote</span>
								<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-neutral-400 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase">Full-Time</span>
							</div>
							<h3 class="font-syne font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white group-hover/jobbtn:text-cyan-400 transition-colors select-text">
								Senior AI Systems Engineer
							</h3>
						</div>
						<!-- Chevron Icon -->
						<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-hover/jobbtn:text-cyan-400 group-hover/jobbtn:border-cyan-500/20 transition-all duration-300 chevron-icon">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
							</svg>
						</div>
					</button>

					<!-- Expandable Details -->
					<div class="job-details hidden border-t border-white/5 bg-[#030307]/40 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
						<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
							<div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
								<h4 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400">Role Overview</h4>
								<p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
									Develop production-ready AI systems using Agentic AI, Generative AI, RAG, and cloud-native platforms. We build, architect, and scale leading AI platforms to help our partners thrive.
								</p>
								<h4 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400 pt-2">Key Responsibilities</h4>
								<ul class="space-y-2.5 text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
									<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
										<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/40 mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
										<span>Architect and deploy scalable Agentic AI and RAG architectures for enterprise applications.</span>
									</li>
									<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
										<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/40 mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
										<span>Mentor team members, perform constructive code reviews, and write clean, maintainable documentation.</span>
									</li>
									<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
										<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/40 mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
										<span>Collaborate with cross-functional teams on high-throughput model inference pipelines.</span>
									</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="space-y-4 lg:border-l lg:border-white/5 lg:pl-8">
								<h4 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400">Stack & Requirements</h4>
								<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-1">
									<span class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Agentic AI</span>
									<span class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">RAG</span>
									<span class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Python</span>
									<span class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">MLOps</span>
									<span class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Cloud Native</span>
								</div>
								<div class="space-y-3 pt-3">
									<div>
										<span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase block">Experience</span>
										<span class="text-white text-xs select-text font-medium">5+ years in AI systems engineering</span>
									</div>
									<div>
										<span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase block">Compensation</span>
										<span class="text-white text-xs select-text font-medium">Competitive Base + Growth Options</span>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex">
							<a href="#apply" data-role="AI Engineering" class="btn-primary apply-to-job-btn !py-2.5 !px-6 !text-xs">
								<span>Apply For This Role</span>
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Position 2: MLOps & AI Operations Engineer -->
				<div class="job-item border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] hover:bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-cyan-500/20 shadow-lg shadow-black/20" data-dept="engineering">
					<!-- Header (Trigger) -->
					<button class="w-full text-left p-6 sm:p-8 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer outline-none group/jobbtn">
						<div class="space-y-2">
							<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
								<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 bg-cyan-400/5 border border-cyan-400/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase">Engineering</span>
								<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-neutral-400 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase">Remote</span>
								<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-neutral-400 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase">Full-Time</span>
							</div>
							<h3 class="font-syne font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white group-hover/jobbtn:text-cyan-400 transition-colors select-text">
								MLOps & AI Operations Specialist
							</h3>
						</div>
						<!-- Chevron Icon -->
						<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-hover/jobbtn:text-cyan-400 group-hover/jobbtn:border-cyan-500/20 transition-all duration-300 chevron-icon">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
							</svg>
						</div>
					</button>

					<!-- Expandable Details -->
					<div class="job-details hidden border-t border-white/5 bg-[#030307]/40 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
						<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
							<div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
								<h4 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400">Role Overview</h4>
								<p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
									Lead the deployment and operations of intelligent automation pipelines, model monitoring, and cloud-native infrastructure for enterprise partners.
								</p>
								<h4 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400 pt-2">Key Responsibilities</h4>
								<ul class="space-y-2.5 text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
									<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
										<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/40 mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
										<span>Establish robust MLOps workflows and automated CI/CD for LLMs and custom ML models.</span>
									</li>
									<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
										<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/40 mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
										<span>Manage Kubernetes clusters and cloud-native services with zero-downtime deployment targets.</span>
									</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="space-y-4 lg:border-l lg:border-white/5 lg:pl-8">
								<h4 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400">Stack & Requirements</h4>
								<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-1">
									<span class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Kubernetes</span>
									<span class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">MLOps</span>
